  "resourcePolicy": "One exclusive host lease covers the coding model, local 4B selector and iOS/Android runtime access. Do not run peer builders or other model workers concurrently. Host simulator/device IDs are supplied in the launch gate, never guessed. No automatic stale-lease takeover.",
